WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.080
COMPARE. Show a wet scene with rain and green plants.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.101
COMPARE. Show a dry scene with sun and drier soil.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.571
CYCLE. Connect wet and dry scenes with a repeating arrow.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:16.269
PLAN. Choose an umbrella for rain and careful water use for dry days.
